--
-- cic.mm0 — the MM0 target theory for the Lean4→DeltaNets→MM0 pipeline,
-- adapted to this project's *existing* term language (unfer/logos deltanet)
-- rather than a generic CIC axiomatization.
--
-- Why adapted: the generic plan (docs/lean4mm0.md) axiomatized the Calculus
-- of Inductive Constructions, but the conversion checker this project
-- actually runs is `logos::deltanet` — a first-order interaction-net
-- reducer over a fixed agent signature (App, Abs, Con, Fold, Dup, Era,
-- Prim, Lit, Entity). Definitional equality here is *net isomorphism after
-- reduction* (the unique-normal-form property), certified by the
-- isomorphism witness π from `deltanet::unf::isomorphism_witness`. This
-- theory speaks exactly that language, so a proof trace emitted for it
-- names real pipeline objects instead of hypothetical ones.
--
-- Validated end-to-end on 2026-10-23: `mm0-rs compile cic.mm0 -> cic.mmb`
-- (3 sorts, 20 terms, 11 axioms, exit 0) and `mm0-c cic.mmb < cic.mm0`
-- (exit 0). Phase D (docs/lean4mm0.md §5/§7) has landed the *theorem*
